/-!
# Hard corner certificate: the derivative chart

Each power-basis stage of the derivative polynomial is a Bernstein evaluation of
the stage before, row by row, so `derivative_chart` proves `clearedDerivative`
positive on the unit cube.

Generated by `scripts/corner_certificate/generate_hard_corner.py`; do not edit
by hand.
-/

@[expose] public section

noncomputable section

